msgctxt "243\t376"
msgid "That Kazama-lookin' guy really said all that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "377\t437"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "429\t483"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "Mmm..."

msgctxt "484\t579"
msgid "Can't help but wonder what he wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592\t713"
msgid ""
"All we know for sure is that he's\\nwrapped up in this whole mess somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "887\t977"
msgid "What's wrong? You still hurt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "978\t1038"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr "Non proprio."

msgctxt "1114\t1277"
msgid "Aniki. I just... don't know\\nwhat to think of all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1295\t1450"
msgid "Why'd that guy with the mustache save my life?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1462\t1626"
msgid "'Specially after he shot the boss.\\n...Why help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1683\t1743"
msgid "Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1760\t1837"
msgid "I need you to head back to Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1869\t1969"
msgid "I have some loose ends to tie up here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1972\t2105"
msgid "But you? There's nothing keeping you in this city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2106\t2126"
msgid "But!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2127\t2200"
msgid "Just hear me out, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2206\t2390"
msgid ""
"Right now, we don't know whether\\nthe man in the sketch is a friend or foe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2399\t2584"
msgid "Go home, be safe. Take care of Saki for me.\\nWatch after Morning Glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2666\t2726"
msgid "Can you do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2761\t2821"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "2953\t3013"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "3021\t3130"
msgid "What? The chairman of the Hakuho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3194\t3239"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3240\t3417"
msgid ""
"You know Mine, from the Hakuho Clan?\\nSounds like he swung over here to see"
" you."
msgstr ""
